OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly start then a largely
OL,6,Fdry and bright day with sunny spells
OL,7,Fand feeling pleasant in the sunshine.
OL,8,FThe odd light shower is possible over
OL,9,FGalloway in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers over Galloway
OL,12,Fsoon dying out. Otherwise, dry with
OL,13,Fclear spells and becoming rather
OL,14,Fchilly in the Southern Upland glens
OL,15,Fwith patchy fog developing.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FEarly fog patches quickly
OL,18,Fclearing to leave a largely dry day
OL,19,Fwith sunny spells. Cloud will increase
OL,20,Fin the afternoon to bring the odd
OL,21,Flight shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
